<title>BRAZIL: Petrobras to get joint venture proposals in July.</title>
<headline>Petrobras to get joint venture proposals in July.</headline>
<byline>Simona de Logu</byline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>A senior Petrobras official said the state oil giant will be receiving in July proposals from companies interested in entering into partnership projects with Petrobras.</p>
<p>Petrobras has identified 150 projects to be carried out in joint ventures with private companies once the Brazilian Congress approves the petroleum bill which regulates the opening of the oil sector to private capital.</p>
</text>
